      "what_must_be_true": "AI datacenter buildouts must keep leading-edge foundry-logic, DRAM/HBM and advanced-packaging equipment demand growing through calendar 2027; AMAT must hold ~24-25% WFE share and convert record backlog into shipments while sustaining 50%+ non-GAAP gross margin; China export-control exposure and mature-node weakness must remain contained (China already down to 28% of revenue); and capacity investments (Singapore, EPIC) must translate into deliverable supply rather than stranded fixed cost if the cycle turns in FY29."
